%% Init-container migration — Storage & Stateful Apps, lab exercise 8 ("You'll end with").
%% The schema-migration init container reaches pg-sts-0 by its stable headless DNS name, creates and
%% fills schema_history, and exits 0; only then does the app container start, and it reads the table
%% that already exists.
%% Shape (diagram-size-guard): LR, three nodes, labels at most 2 lines, no subgraph.
flowchart LR
  INIT["init container<br/>schema-migration"] -->|"CREATE TABLE, INSERT"| DB[("pg-sts-0.pg-sts<br/>schema_history")]
  INIT -->|"exits 0, then"| APP["app container<br/>starts"]
  APP -->|"SELECT"| DB
  classDef hi fill:#e00,stroke:#900,color:#fff;
  classDef done fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#137333,color:#0d652d;
  class INIT hi;
  class APP,DB done;
